# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local

# Normalised copies of the icons actually used. Regenerated by `npm run icons`,
# which predev/prebuild always run. The two registry.*.generated.ts files ARE
# committed — `npm run icons:check` fails CI when they go stale.
src/assets/icons-generated/

# Local environment. None exist today; this is here so one cannot arrive by
# accident. Nothing in this build needs a secret — there is no server to hold
# credentials for — so a .env appearing is itself worth noticing.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Figma exports. Generated by `npm run export:figma`, never edited.
#
# **Anchored to the project root, and it has to be.** Written as `export/` it
# matched a folder of that name at every depth, which silently excluded
# `scripts/export/` — the exporter itself, which is source. Nothing warns you:
# an ignore rule reports no collateral, and the folder simply never appears in
# `git status`.
/export/
